abstract: "Umbrella record of the ORCHID data release: literature values, calculated binary phase diagrams, binary convex hulls, the DFT-vs-experiment formation-enthalpy benchmark, the phase registry, assessed phase assemblages, ESPEI datasets and the bibliography. Version 1, machine-extracted: values were read from papers by language-model readers constrained to quote their source and checked automatically (quote verification, field-placement rule, printed-page sign checks, DFT and Kim et al. 2017 cross-checks); a hand-checked precision sample is in progress."
